# Coveo

> Coveo is an AI-powered search and recommendations platform designed to provide personalized, relevant, and actionable content across digital experiences. It leverages machine learning and natural language processing to improve search results and recommendations, enabling businesses to deliver tailored customer experiences. Coveo's solutions integrate seamlessly with existing enterprise systems, providing intelligent search capabilities for eCommerce, customer service, and enterprise applications. By optimizing content discovery and data insights, Coveo helps organizations increase engagement, drive conversions, and improve customer satisfaction.

> Key terms: ai powered personalization, gen ai platform, recommendation engine, enterprise search software, ecommerce search platform

## Platform

- [Platform](https://www.coveo.com/en/platform): Coveo's platform provides powerful AI-driven search and recommendations, delivering personalized, relevant content across various digital touchpoints. It helps businesses enhance customer experiences by leveraging machine learning and natural language processing technologies to improve content discovery.

- [Agentic AI](https://www.coveo.com/en/platform/agentic-ai): Coveo’s Agentic AI solution leverages artificial intelligence to automate tasks, improve business processes, and enhance customer interactions. This intelligent solution adapts to business needs, offering real-time recommendations and insights powered by AI.

- [Generative AI](https://www.coveo.com/en/platform/generative-ai): Coveo’s Generative AI technology helps organizations create personalized and dynamic content for their users. It enhances customer experiences by generating content that is contextually relevant and aligned with user preferences, improving engagement.

- [Recommender Systems](https://www.coveo.com/en/platform/recommender-systems): Coveo’s recommender systems utilize machine learning to deliver personalized content recommendations. These systems improve user engagement by suggesting relevant products, services, or content based on individual preferences and behaviors.

- [Passage Retrieval API](https://www.coveo.com/en/lp/passage-retrieval-api): The Passage Retrieval API from Coveo enables efficient and accurate content retrieval by breaking down complex queries into smaller passages. This API is designed to deliver precise answers from large datasets, enhancing the speed and accuracy of search results.

- [Contextual Help](https://www.coveo.com/en/platform/contextual-help): Coveo’s Contextual Help feature offers real-time, personalized assistance to users by providing relevant support content based on their current activity. It improves user experiences by offering timely help and guidance when needed.

- [Security](https://www.coveo.com/en/platform/security): Coveo’s security platform ensures the protection of sensitive data across its AI-driven search and recommendation systems. It provides robust security features, including encryption and user authentication, to safeguard enterprise-level information.

- [Intelligent Search](https://www.coveo.com/en/platform/intelligent-search): Coveo’s Intelligent Search platform uses AI to deliver relevant, context-aware search results. It enhances user satisfaction by providing accurate, personalized, and actionable search results across websites, applications, and enterprise systems.

- [Technology](https://www.coveo.com/en/platform/technology): Coveo’s Technology section highlights the advanced technologies driving its platform, including AI, machine learning, and natural language processing. These technologies power Coveo’s intelligent search, personalization, and recommendation solutions for businesses worldwide.

- [Personalized Experiences](https://www.coveo.com/en/platform/personalized-experiences): Coveo’s personalized experiences allow businesses to offer tailored content, recommendations, and search results based on individual user profiles and behaviors. This approach enhances user engagement and drives conversion by delivering relevant experiences.

